Hello All,

Customer Service:  direct all inquiries concerning NSF "approvals" for DI n=
ipples to the Harco Regional Sales Manager.

Sales Team:


1.       We do not have an NSF 61 listing for our Ductile Iron Nipples per =
se.

2.       The manufacturers of the coatings used on the DI Nipples have NSF =
61 listings for the coatings.

3.       Our approach in response to requests for "NSF approval" is to prov=
ide the listings for the coatings we use.  See Info Blurt 25.  And to persu=
ade the customer that this establishes compliance with NSF 61 standards for=
 our DI Nipples.

4.       This approach is the same used by the major ductile iron fitting m=
anufacturers.  Neither Tyler/Union, Sigma Corporation, or Star Pipe Product=
s have NSF 61 listings for their fittings as fittings but claim NSF complia=
nce.

5.       If the customer does not accept the approach in Item 3 then determ=
ine which manufacturers of fittings are used and if this includes the brand=
s in Item 4  present this information to the customer requesting equivalent=
 treatment.

6.       Report details of occasions where this approach does not result in=
 approval.

John
=3D

--_000_9B7E2735CEC37E4D9137A9548F21D78372545FCA20MAIL_
